        "sid": "2CH 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghami Yehoshafati ak geebung'sa murdeeda ghweanigaaschi, aba ng'ata geebung'siinyi sea ghweanigaaschi aba jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi, ama ng'ata gawa hoorgeadaanyi Yehorameeda was orjeedaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gwandeawa orjooga ghwaan siguura Asariya ea Yehieli sea Sakariya, ea Asariya, ea Mikaeli, ea Shefatiya, fiisu seaniini orjooga Yehoshafati gil was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghweanda nyaawa ghoadaw saawa haleanjeeda hayapta was lapiya, ea dahaabu, ea haleanjeeda saang'a jea gwahearan, ea mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga bea Yuda; aba ng'ata ghoadaw Yehoramu gheambalmeeda aba gideaba niny duweacheeda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea nuwa Yehoramu uhuuda hoorgeeda ghwaan nea ninyas uurda, hean gahuuyda orjooga ghwaan aba ng'uta, sea fiisu ng'ay was fuga hees bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda Yehoramu gaba gweanyeew diktam ea damaniyeenya damanda siikghaambiit ghoah sugoocheanda; hean ng'ata goombaliischi gweanyeew sis aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat naweeda sugoodiga Israeli, gawuurji gida sin gheeh Ahabu; aba gideaba hudeaba gatmoadaanyi gil, Hean gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea NG'UTAMIIDA ea magasa ghwadatas gheeh Dawdi, gweagu neajeeda ghayi sin niny sea Dawdi, gawuurji gida rukusiinda gideaba gayghoadaw niny gheaboong'nyeanda ea diibigaaschi damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak damandida ghoang'aamwa geat fuga Edomu gheambalmeeda Yuda, aba ng'ata ghamiinda sugoocheanda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoaghaaw Yehoramu sea shirikarajeagaaschi ea mutukwajeagaaschi sean, ng'ata ghang'eat eawa ak ghabwar goosha fuga sean bea Edomu mida giischeewdaanyi nea gaweechi sea shirikarajeagaaschi manmani mutukwajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fuga Edomu ghoang'aamwa heeda gheambalmeeda Yuda ea ghoah ghamneawa. Ak aba damandida ghoang'aamwa geaw Libna heeda gheambalmeadaanyi, aba gideaba ninung'wa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gicha gwasin heetiyeada aba ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Yuda, ak ghoadoabiiw fuga bea ng'eanyiida gwasin ng'asheega munyas, ak ghwanung' ghwaschoarda fuga Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu headaanyi barawajeanda leabu heeda sibaneeda siguura Eliya, ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Dawdeeda was ghweandaang'u, ‘Aba gideaba mudu aada naweeda Yehoshafateeda was ghweandaang'u, ghana naweeda Asa was sugoocheanda Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghamneawa ea niyaadi naweadinga sugoodiga Israeli, nea niidoabiiwi fuga Yuda sea fuga bea ng'eanyiida bea Yerusalemu gwasin ng'asheega munyas, gawuurji gidadoabiiwda gheeh Ahabu fuga Israeli gwasin ng'asheega munyas, ak gicha ea ninuusi orjooga giyeang'wa, bea gheeda ghweandaang'u, was fuga doobiiweadi ea ghang'alnyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ula, NG'UTAMIIDA gaygwajaksa bileangida haw badahuuka fugaagu, ea diibiga ea gadeemga, ea haleanjeadaang'u sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ang'iing'i gaynyasa geeyooda haw jea gwarina jeadaang'u, nea gaygwayi bwak ea gwardu jarooda hiineegaagu aba ng'asheega geeyooda aba galeagasean.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA ghwanyareas fuga Filisti sea fuga Arabu was fuga ascheayi Gushi, ak ghang'eatng'eat gang'uchi Yehoramu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gwadiyeesa ng'eanyiida Yuda, ak ghwanaaw aba ng'ata ghwaat haleanjeeda nyas was gea gheeda sugoocheanda, hean eara diibigaaschi, ea gadeemgaaschi, nea manda orjeeda siipuut geaghus Ahasiya was orjeedaanyi mwanang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea ning'ata ng'asheesu ghwalasa NG'UTAMIIDA niny geeyooda jeesinga nea ea manda giiheapta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea ning'ata eawoojisu ng'ay, nea ning'ata gweanyeew iyeenya, gooruuna geeyooda hiineegaaschi aba jih, ng'ata ghami nea gwanda jeeda sawanadeeda. Nea fugaaschi ea maghwara beasta aba murdeadaanyi, gawuurji gida sisisiinda ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea damaniyeenya damanda ang'eat giimbaliischooda, aba ng'ata goombaliischi gweanyeew sis aba Yerusalemu, hean ghami nea manda siisi bwariiy. Ng'ata geebung'sa jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi, nea ea mii jeeda bung'eadinga sugoodiga gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
